# Local FE → production API (Railway) via same-origin Next proxy
# Activate: npm run env:prod
#
# Prerequisites:
#   1. Railway CORS_ORIGINS includes http://localhost:3000
#   2. Google OAuth redirect URI includes:
#      http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/google/callback
#   3. API deployed with return_to support
#
# If curl to Railway works but localhost /api returns 502 with a TLS error,
# corporate SSL interception is likely. Temporary local workaround:
#   NODE_TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED=0 npm run dev
API_PROXY_TARGET=https://donna-assistant.up.railway.app
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=same-origin
